_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.125.100:block:10","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.125.100","text":"(j) A corporation, if any officer, manager, director or stockholder would be ineligible to receive a license as an individual. (Code 1981 § 37-62. Code 1995 § 30-208.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"bfbdc594-f003-5930-95f6-b86a65773753"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.125.100","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.125.100","content_hash":"4fd7ef05d4c623870c7d80e52049d92e5da68bee2af976a1f0bd55965c659c0a","heading":null,"ordinal":11,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.125.100:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.125.100:block:11","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.125.100","text":"State Law References: Similar provisions, K.S.A. 16-708 .","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"4d3e6fdb-aa7d-5cc0-afbf-0f242c50cf13"}],"root_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.125.100:section","schema":"exais.jurisdiction.structured_content.v1"}